d_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159081767", "author": {"steamid": "76561198149092542", "personaname": "普信女三鹰朝天下第一", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198149092542/", "num_games_owned": 107, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 30614, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5247, "last_played": 1778507816, "avatar": "c79fafaec5b8528fc122239ef95309388bcce29e"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "★☆☆☆☆\n该游戏开发商涉嫌违反多条超级地球宪法，现已提交至超级地球至高司法委员会审查。\n以下为罪行清单：\n1、玩忽职守罪，不奋斗在维护游戏和服务器的第一线是不忠诚的。\n2、庇护外星异形罪，有证据表明，箭头默认了许多虫子（bug）的存在，并且不予以解决。\n3、贪污战争资产罪，我们有理由相信，大部分绝地潜兵的装备并未完全交予前线的民主战士手中。\n4、非法度假罪，经审查发现，该开发商全体人员并未填写HO-114514号度假申请书。\n5、漠视超级公民罪，忽视又交税又奋斗在解放前线的公民的合理需求，是明显不履行义务的行为。\n以上，建议超级地球至高司法委员会和民主执行委员会将箭头全体工作人员押送至生化斯坦，并将其罐装成机仆，让其更好的为超级地球服务。", "timestamp_created": 1708714802, "timestamp_updated": 1708714802, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159081331", "author": {"steamid": "76561198260275062", "personaname": "沉隅", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198260275062/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 22391, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 21139, "last_played": 1748765335, "avatar": "f097e084eb25152d2fa0b593c9dca9bd060d125f"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏现阶段很垃圾好玩也好玩，服务器辣鸡，反作弊器2000年的辣鸡产物，经常各种BUG劝退，每次小更新就一堆BUG，不建议现在购买在观望最好（3月7好的更新直接让我CPU直接拉满，然后各种报错闪退，卡死，闪退，莫名其妙掉出，现在我修改强烈建议别买，等这帮傻逼把游戏弄好在玩也不迟，或者等个超级打折几十块买当作给他们上个香，别都死了）强烈建议别买，现在更新，不是闪退就是无缘无故回到主机的飞船，还有给你网络错误，一句没打完各种错误辣鸡服务器，开给你吗买棺材了？（傻逼游戏现在各种报错闪退，莫名其妙闪退，让电脑突然卡死闪退）大家别买买了这帮B老外还会骂人乱打人，乱T人，煞笔服务器躺你妈棺材里都比你MB里信号强，什么脑瘫设计的利维坦？无限打倒莫名其妙穿几个房子秒杀？设计师爸妈儿女刚死不久？设计师最好全死绝！", "timestamp_created": 1708714482, "timestamp_updated": 1747990818, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.518518567085266113", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159080701", "author": {"steamid": "76561199263376659", "personaname": "马枪怪", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199263376659/", "num_games_owned": 79, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 6986, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2311, "last_played": 1727803996, "avatar": "b9ed33299eaa5960f2225be27345040dfe6a5ed7"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好玩好玩，深岩银河成人版\n", "timestamp_created": 1708713978, "timestamp_updated": 1708713978, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159080288", "author": {"steamid": "76561199036264174", "personaname": "Bender", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199036264174/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 5252, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 122, "last_played": 1758627301, "avatar": "99b664d59e3bf32f0ebd02354a1c2ba963f6ab8b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "To the Steam Support Team:\n\nSUBJECT: REQUEST SPECIAL CONSIDERATION - ABOUT REFUND REQUESTS DUE TO POLICY CHANGES FOR HELLDIVERS™ 2.\n\nDear Customer Service Team,\n\nI AM WRITING TO REQUEST A REFUND FOR THE HELLDIVERS™ 2 I PURCHASED ON February 23rd. At first, I was attracted to the game's promotional approach to the flexible Banding policy, which gives players the freedom to link their Steam account to their PlayStation Network (PSN) account. Based on this explanation, I happily made the purchase.\n\nHowever, the recent sudden announcement by the publisher that the game will require all users to link a PSN account in order to play the game is a significant change from the terms I knew and accepted when I made the purchase. As a platform that respects the choices of users, I believe that Steam also values the rights and interests of consumers and the expectations at the time of purchase.\n\nAlthough I understand that Steam's standard refund policy is within 14 days of purchase and no more than 2 hours of gameplay, my situation is beyond that, I think my situation is unique and deserves special consideration. This policy change is equivalent to changing the basis of our service agreement, making it impossible for me to continue to enjoy the game on Steam without hindrance, against my original purchase intention.\n\nIn light of the above, I implore the Steam team to understand my position and consider offering a one-time refund service as a reasonable response to this sudden change. I remain a firm believer in Steam's commitment to protecting the rights of our consumers, and I look forward to your continued customer support on this issue.\n\nFor ease of processing, I attach the necessary purchase information:\n\n●Game Name: HELLDIVERS™ 2\n\n●Date of Purchase: February 23rd\n\n- Play time: More than 2 hours, but you can't continue the game due to a policy change\n\n●Transaction ID: 4053872903727349511\n\nI sincerely hope that we can find a satisfactory solution and thank you for taking the time to review my request. We look forward to your positive response.\n\nMost sincerely, REINFORCE\n\nMay 6, 2024", "timestamp_created": 1708713609, "timestamp_updated": 1714965235, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159080182", "author": {"steamid": "76561198107251379", "personaname": "ROACH", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/1134097444/", "num_games_owned": 179, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 8229, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1313, "playtime_at_review": 2781, "last_played": 1788025834, "avatar": "ee5cc428258a2f7f5775ae66f8bbcde744738e44"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "除了武器系统没有上一代舒服，服务器的稳定比之前要好很多，一场伟大的进步，希望有更多的好武器，保留上一代的强度和新一代的创新，两年以前，我打退了生化人、光能人和虫族，这一次我还会拥护超级地球。", "timestamp_created": 1708713509, "timestamp_updated": 1708713509, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.498915404081344604", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159080098", "author": {"steamid": "76561198838425700", "personaname": "氪服困难", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198838425700/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3927, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 82, "last_played": 1720363990, "avatar": "e0345d95a99a0280d31aaec05676eaad7a125d2c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不推荐好友联机一直进不去.要不进去秒退.还一堆bug", "timestamp_created": 1708713443, "timestamp_updated": 1708713443, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_durin